EVEN moduli 2^j m. Columns (sheet 0 / sheet 1):
  R_prod  = (2^j m) max_{c odd} |#{N=c} - 2^(1-j) sum_{d | gcd(m,c-c_s)} (d/m) D^(d)| / #T   (first-order product law)
  R_m     = the same remainder at the odd modulus m alone
  R_flat  = max over classes e mod m and odd a mod 2^j of |2^(j-1) #{N=a mod 2^j, N=e mod m}/#{N=e mod m} - 1|
